cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LeukoAI, please cite the article listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "LeukoAI: Morphology-Based Leukemia Prediction Tool"
abstract: >-
  Standalone Windows application that predicts the presence and type of
  leukemia (acute vs. chronic; ALL, AML, CLL, CML) from 1000x MGG-stained
  peripheral blood smear images using hierarchical DenseNet-121 models.
  For research and educational use only.
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0
